      "id": "519416e6-6828-32f3-1949-cd869965d53a",
      "name": "Cost of Living - Community Welcome Space- Helping Homeless Believe",
      "description": "<p data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Services; Free tea and coffee, Mental health support, Free wi-fi, Free charging points for phone and other devices, Budgeting advice on managing utility bills, Information, advice and guidance services, Activities such as cooking and budgeting courses, Mentoring , Job Club.<br></p><p data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">There is a main car park with disabled bays, its ground floor so no steps to the building and we have disabled toilet.</p><p>Individuals can use our WiFi and electricity to charge devices and access their universal credit journals and checking their home choice applications through our computers. We also have a shower facility for those that are street homeless.</p><p aria-hidden=\"true\"><br></p>",
