    "data": {
      "id": "640fb4b3-f3b4-8fd0-31dd-57ca288e8bd5",
      "name": "Cost of Living - Community Welcome Space- The Beacon",
      "description": "<p>A very warm welcome, pay-as-you-can caf\u00e9 serving great quality, locally sourced hot &amp; cold food, drinks, cake and snacks. <br></p><p>All donations are anonymous. <br></p><p>Companionship, support &amp; signposting. Separate indoor play area for children. On the first Tuesday of every month, we run a popular pay-as-you-can Eat &amp; Meet 2-course lunch. <br></p><p>Everyone is welcome and there are always several people to chat to and get to know. <br></p><p>Must be pre-booked on our website, by phone or in person. Whilst our indoor play area is open at all times, we run a Bumps, Babies &amp; Tots group every Friday between 10am and 12pm where users can meet other parents and have a safe space for their children to play. We host The Centre for Deaf once a month, new members are very welcome. Please check the latest dates at <a data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CfDHoH\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CfDHoH\">https://www.facebook.com/CfDHoH</a><br></p><p>Tuesday 12pm \u2013 2pm 1st Tuesday of every month, Eat &amp; Meet (must be booked in advance). Thursday and Friday 9am - 3pm (food until 2pm). Saturday 9am-2pm (food until 1.30pm).<br></p>",
      "url": "http://www.example.com",
      "email": "thebeacon@wearebs15.co.uk",
